		"en": [
			"From \"30 MINUTES FANTASY\", where you can create your own fantasy job, \"Class Up Armor (Rozan Fortress)\" is now available!",
			"• “Armor Cross” [Armor Replacement] A set of armor and weapons that can be “classed up” to a higher-level job.",
			"• By combining with the separately sold \"30MF Rozan Lancer\", it can be \"classed up\" to the \"Rozan Fortress\".",
			"• The attribute of “element core” is “lightning”."
